WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.875
Nine point three billion dollars.

00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:07.237
The Phoenix Pay System was estimated at 309 million.

00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:10.987
It became a 9.3 billion dollar disaster.

00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:15.175
216,000 transactions still backlogged.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:19.387
133,000 public servants still affected.

00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:24.187
Won't be fixed until 2031 — fifteen years after it broke.
